      "content": "SP 90 SW              CHARTRIDGE              CHARTRIDGE                                               (north side) 5/27                                          Mapletree Farm East and                                               Mapletree Farm West - GV                                            II House.  C17 altered, extended and sub-divided.  Timber framed refronted in brick, east wing flint and brick.  Tiled roof, old chimney stack in centre.  Two storeys, modern leaded windows with segmental arches to ground floor.  Central C20 2-storey porch with hipped roof, two windows to left hand, the first floor ones under gables.  Three windows to right hand part.  West gable has exposed timber framing and projecting chimney stack.  Large C20 wing at rear.  Interior:  two large inglenook fireplaces, exposed beams. Listing NGR: SP9331103698"
    }
